idens\n\u2022 Unlock fun trophies\n\u2022 Fun for the entire family and great for parties\n\nMade in the USA by Little 10 Robot", "short_description": "Take on Ram-Bam, Lamb-Bam and the whole bleatin' clan in the exciting Alpine climbing adventure that pits your wits against the meanest sheep in the mountain. Climb every mountain. Watch every turn."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.little10robot.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Little 10 Robot", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.little10robot.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "914637366629034"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "564406025539128"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "564406025539128"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1681319940, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "564406025539128"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6170214263027238", "version": "1.0.3"}, "id": "1338277970346989", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "A